<title>USA: N. Richland, Texas, $2 mln won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>N. Richland, Texas, $2 mln won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said it won $2.755 million of North Richland Hills, Texas, tax, waterworks and sewer system revenue limited tax certificates of obligation, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.591 percent.</p>
</text>
